error[L0334]: a pattern in the binding list of `let-match` has no value
  --> expand/let_match_binding_list_errors.knv:13:15
   |
13 |   (let-match (value) (ok value)))
   |               ^^^^^ this pattern has no value
   |
   = help: write its value after it, as `(let-match (value value) ...)`

error[L0334]: a pattern in the binding list of `let-match` has no value
  --> expand/let_match_binding_list_errors.knv:16:15
   |
16 |   (let-match ((value (parse text)))
   |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this pattern has no value
   |
   = help: write its value after it, as `(let-match ((value (parse text)) value) ...)`, or write each name and its value without their own parentheses, as `(let-match (value (parse text)) ...)`

error[L0334]: a pattern in the binding list of `let-match` has no value
  --> expand/let_match_binding_list_errors.knv:20:15
   |
20 |   (let-match ((some x)) (println x)))
   |               ^^^^^^^^ this pattern has no value
   |
   = help: write its value after it, as `(let-match ((some x) value) ...)`

error[L0336]: each name and its value go straight into the binding list of `let-match`, without their own parentheses
